"Which color is the opposite of red? It depends on the wheel. On the painter's wheel the answer is green. On the screen wheel the pairs are red and cyan, green and magenta, and blue and yellow. Both wheels are useful. One grew out of mixing paint and the other fits mixing light, as you saw in Lesson 1. When someone says two colors are complementary, it is fair to ask which wheel they mean.": "931ce2cf27fc",
